<title>HONG KONG: Nissho Iwai HK sets 1.0 bln yen bond.</title>
<headline>Nissho Iwai HK sets 1.0 bln yen bond.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following senior, unsecured fixed rate step-up note issue was announced by arranger DKB ASIA.</p>
<p>BORROWER  NISSHO IWAI HK (CAYMAN) LTD</p>
<p> AMOUNT    JPY 1 BLN   COUPON     *STEP-UP MATURITY  10 YRS</p>
<p> TYPE FIXED RATE NOTE  ISS PRICE  100.40   DENOMS    Y100 MLN</p>
<p> PUTS	--	    CALLS	**	 COMMON CODE 7403062</p>
<p> LISTING   HK	    REPAYMENT  --	 ISIN XS007403062-7</p>
<p> RATING    A (BY NIS)  SALE LMTS  US/UK/HK/JAPAN</p>
<p> NEG PLG   YES	   CRS DEF    YES	FORCE MAJ YES</p>
<p> HOME CTRY JAPAN	 GOV LAW    ENGLISH  PAY DATE 13.MAR.97</p>
<p>FULL FEE  40 BP</p>
<p> NOTES     *YR 1  2.00% P.A (30/360)   YR 6  3.25%  P.A (30/360)</p>
<p>		YR 2  2.25% P.A (30/360)   YR 7  3.50%  P.A (30/360)</p>
<p>		YR 3  2.50% P.A (30/360)   YR 8  3.75%  P.A (30/360)</p>
<p>		YR 4  2.75% P.A (30/360)   YR 9  4.00%  P.A (30/360)</p>
<p>		YR 5  3.00% P.A (30/360)   YR10  4.25%  P.A (30/360)</p>
<p>	    **CALLABLE ON EACH INTEREST PAYMENT DATE COMMENCING</p>
<p>		MARCH 13, 1998</p>
<p>	   ***ISSUED UNDER THE ISSUER'S US$1 BLN ASIAN DRAGON</p>
<p>		MEDIUM TERM NOTE PROGRAMME</p>
<p>	  ****SECURITY THROUGH KEEPWELL AGREEMENT GIVEN BY NISSHO</p>
<p>		IWAI CORP</p>
<p>--Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2847 4039</p>
